  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-translate-kit · 翻译工坊",
      "text": "Translation quality kit: **persistent glossary + dual-version translation + back-translation check**, mounted as resident rules plus a glossary tool."
    },
    {
      "section": "常驻纪律",
      "text": "①先查术语表（专有名词不自造译名）②新术语译完即沉淀（同词永远同译·跨会话一致）③重要文案双译对照（直译/意译各一版）④语域对齐（读者是谁决定术语密度）⑤高stakes文案回译自检。"
    },
    {
      "section": "工具 `translate_glossary`",
      "text": "| action | 干什么 |\n|---|---|\n| `查` | 读术语表（可按关键词过滤） |\n| `加` | 新增/更新词条（source→target+语境） |\n| `删` | 删除词条 |\n\n术语表存 `workspace/glossary.json`（文件名可配），跨会话复用。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```\ndsh plugin add github:xushilianzhuren/dsh-translate-kit\n```\nMIT License."
    }
  ],
